<section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Developer details</p><h1><%= @recommendation.book.title %> のスコア</h1><p>通常画面には表示しない、検証用の順位と検索スコアです。</p></section>
<dl class="score-list"><dt>Algorithm</dt><dd><%= @recommendation.algorithm %></dd><dt>Backend</dt><dd><%= @recommendation.score_details['backend'] %></dd><dt>Original rank</dt><dd><%= @recommendation.score_details['original_rank'] %></dd><dt>Final rank</dt><dd><%= @recommendation.score_details['final_rank'] %></dd><dt>BM25</dt><dd><%= @recommendation.score_details['bm25_score'] || '—' %></dd><dt>Vector</dt><dd><%= @recommendation.score_details['vector_score'] || '—' %></dd><dt>RRF</dt><dd><%= @recommendation.score_details['rrf_score'] || '—' %></dd><dt>Reranker</dt><dd><%= @recommendation.score_details['reranker_score'] || '—' %></dd><dt>Reading pattern fit</dt><dd><%= @recommendation.score_details['reading_pattern_fit'] %></dd><dt>Goal fit</dt><dd><%= @recommendation.score_details['reading_goal_fit'] %></dd><dt>Novelty</dt><dd><%= @recommendation.score_details['novelty'] %></dd><dt>Diversity</dt><dd><%= @recommendation.score_details['diversity'] %></dd><dt>Feedback fit</dt><dd><%= @recommendation.score_details['feedback_fit'] %></dd><dt>Final score</dt><dd><%= @recommendation.score_details['final_score'] %></dd><dt>Query expansion</dt><dd><%= Array(@recommendation.score_details['query_expansion']).join(' / ').presence || '—' %></dd></dl>
